---
layout: base.njk
eleventyNavigation:
    key: Home
    order: 1
---

<section class="py-[72px] pb-[60px]">
    <div class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-accent before:block before:h-px before:w-6 before:bg-accent">
        CTO · Angular GDE · Nx Champion
    </div>
    <h1 class="mb-7 font-serif text-[clamp(38px,6vw,56px)] leading-[1.08] tracking-tight text-ink">
        I build software that<br />
        <em class="italic text-accent">makes a difference</em>.<br />
    </h1>
    <p class="mb-10 max-w-[540px] text-base leading-[1.65] text-ink2">
        I'm Jay Bell — CTO &amp; Co-Founder of
        <a href="https://trellis.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Trellis.org</a>, a social
        enterprise empowering global collective impact. With over 10 years of experience steering Trellis's
        technical direction, I specialize in Nx, Angular, Nest, TypeScript, and building open source that
        the community runs on.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3.5">
        <a
            class="inline-block bg-ink px-6 py-3 font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.04em] text-surface hover:bg-accent hover:text-surface"
            href="/about/"
            >About me →</a
        >
        <a
            class="inline-block border border-line bg-transparent px-6 py-3 font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.04em] text-ink hover:border-ink3 hover:text-ink"
            href="https://github.com/yharaskrik"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer noopener"
            >GitHub / Open Source</a
        >
    </div>
</section>

<div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 pb-7 pt-12 scroll-mt-20" id="things">
    <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink3">Things I'm up to</span>
    <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-line"></div>
</div>

<div class="flex flex-col border-t border-line">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-start gap-6 border-b border-line py-7 transition-[background,padding-left] duration-100 hover:bg-surface2 hover:pl-3 max-sm:grid-cols-1">
        <div>
            <div class="mb-2 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.05em] text-ink3">01 — Podcast</div>
            <div class="mb-2 font-serif text-2xl text-ink">The Angular Plus Show</div>
            <div class="mb-3.5 max-w-[480px] text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-ink2">
                The home of ng-conf's official all-Angular podcast. Stay up to date on the latest in the
                Angular community, with bonus episodes from The Dev Life podcast.
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-surface3 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink2">Angular</span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-surface3 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink2">ng-conf</span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-surface3 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink2">Podcast</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="min-w-[120px] pr-4 text-right max-sm:pr-0 max-sm:text-left">
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-ink3">Listen</span>
            <a class="mt-2.5 block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink3 hover:text-accent" href="/podcast/">Podcasts →</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-start gap-6 border-b border-line py-7 transition-[background,padding-left] duration-100 hover:bg-surface2 hover:pl-3 max-sm:grid-cols-1">
        <div>
            <div class="mb-2 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.05em] text-ink3">02 — Hobby</div>
            <div class="mb-2 font-serif text-2xl text-ink">Horde 40k</div>
            <div class="mb-3.5 max-w-[480px] text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-ink2">
                A Warhammer 40k companion app built with Angular and Nx — my playground for big-monorepo
                architecture, performance, and modern Angular.
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-surface3 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink2">Angular</span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-surface3 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink2">Nx</span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-surface3 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink2">Warhammer 40k</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="min-w-[120px] pr-4 text-right max-sm:pr-0 max-sm:text-left">
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-ink3">Try it</span>
            <a class="mt-2.5 block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink3 hover:text-accent" href="https://horde-40k.web.app" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Horde →</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-start gap-6 border-b border-line py-7 transition-[background,padding-left] duration-100 hover:bg-surface2 hover:pl-3 max-sm:grid-cols-1">
        <div>
            <div class="mb-2 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.05em] text-ink3">03 — Community</div>
            <div class="mb-2 font-serif text-2xl text-ink">Angular GDE &amp; Nx Champion</div>
            <div class="mb-3.5 max-w-[480px] text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-ink2">
                I help grow the Angular and Nx communities through talks, streams, open source, and
                mentoring. Check my contributions on GitHub.
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-surface3 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink2">Angular</span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-surface3 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink2">Nx</span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-surface3 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink2">Community</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="min-w-[120px] pr-4 text-right max-sm:pr-0 max-sm:text-left">
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-ink3">Profile</span>
            <a class="mt-2.5 block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink3 hover:text-accent" href="https://developers.google.com/profile/u/jaycooperbell" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Google →</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-start gap-6 border-b border-line py-7 transition-[background,padding-left] duration-100 hover:bg-surface2 hover:pl-3 max-sm:grid-cols-1">
        <div>
            <div class="mb-2 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.05em] text-ink3">04 — Work</div>
            <div class="mb-2 font-serif text-2xl text-ink">Trellis</div>
            <div class="mb-3.5 max-w-[480px] text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-ink2">
                Building software that has to hold up when it matters most — empowering global collective
                impact for charities and their donors.
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-surface3 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink2">Startup</span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-surface3 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink2">Social Enterprise</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="min-w-[120px] pr-4 text-right max-sm:pr-0 max-sm:text-left">
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-ink3">Company</span>
            <a class="mt-2.5 block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink3 hover:text-accent" href="https://trellis.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">trellis.org →</a>
            <a class="mt-2.5 block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink3 hover:text-accent" href="https://tech.trellis.org" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Tech blog →</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-start gap-6 border-b border-line py-7 transition-[background,padding-left] duration-100 hover:bg-surface2 hover:pl-3 max-sm:grid-cols-1">
        <div>
            <div class="mb-2 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.05em] text-ink3">05 — Show</div>
            <div class="mb-2 font-serif text-2xl text-ink">This is Tech Talks</div>
            <div class="mb-3.5 max-w-[480px] text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-ink2">
                A show about tech, software, and the people building it — watch the streams I've been a
                part of on YouTube.
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-surface3 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink2">Tech</span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-surface3 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink2">Talks</span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-surface3 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink2">YouTube</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="min-w-[120px] pr-4 text-right max-sm:pr-0 max-sm:text-left">
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-ink3">Watch</span>
            <a class="mt-2.5 block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.03em] text-ink3 hover:text-accent" href="https://www.youtube.com/@jaybell7291" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">YouTube →</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 pb-7 pt-12 scroll-mt-20" id="blog">
    <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink3">Blog</span>
    <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-line"></div>
</div>

<div class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-2.5">
    {% set posts = collections.posts | head(3) %}
    {% if posts.length %}
        {% for post in posts %}
            <a
                class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6 border border-line border-l-[3px] border-l-accent bg-surface p-[26px_30px] text-inherit no-underline transition-[background,border-color] duration-150 hover:bg-surface2 hover:border-ink3"
                href="{{ post.url }}"
            >
                <div>
                    <div class="mb-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-accent">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</div>
                    <div class="mb-1.5 max-w-[520px] font-serif text-[clamp(20px,3.5vw,26px)] leading-[1.18] text-ink">{{ post.data.title }}</div>
                    {% if post.data.description %}
                        <div class="max-w-[520px] text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-ink3">{{ post.data.description }}</div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.04em] text-accent transition-[transform,color] duration-150 group-hover:translate-x-1 hover:translate-x-1 hover:text-ink">Read →</span>
            </a>
        {% endfor %}
        <a class="mt-4 block text-right font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.04em] text-ink3 hover:text-accent" href="/blog/">Browse the full stream →</a>
    {% else %}
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6 border border-line border-l-[3px] border-l-accent bg-surface p-[26px_30px]">
            <div>
                <div class="mb-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-accent">Coming soon</div>
                <div class="mb-1.5 max-w-[520px] font-serif text-[clamp(20px,3.5vw,26px)] leading-[1.18] text-ink">First post is on its way</div>
                <div class="max-w-[520px] text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-ink3">Check back soon for writing on Angular, Nx, open source, and startups.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    {% endif %}
</div>
